ALERT: Agents must read `AGENT=1 cron-person skill` before using this tool.
command: cron-person hook
summary: Generate shell integration hook script
description: Prints hook script for bash, zsh, or fish for direnv-like prompt warnings on unauthorized .cronrc files.
usage: cron-person hook <bash|zsh|fish> [flags]
args:
  - <bash|zsh|fish>: Target shell name
flags:
  --config string: Path to custom configuration file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
  -h, --help bool: help for hook
  --store string: Path to custom authorization state file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
